{"unit_id":"Summer-Perilla__dsh-ui-custom#card-zh","repo":"Summer-Perilla/dsh-ui-custom","commit":"47c6b82123af062c200c697d394eb9dd343aa2f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-custom（DSH 网页插件）：为 Web GUI 增加可视化尺寸编辑模式。插件接入 DSH 的 layout 客户端模块，并在页面加入编辑入口和控制面板。用户可以调整侧栏与布局列宽，拾取元素修改宽、高、位置、字号或隐藏元素，也能多选批量调整、拖动吸附对齐并撤销重做。适合需要按个人习惯整理 DSH 网页工作区的用户。设置保存在浏览器本地，无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:8-14","lib/client.js:977-1040","lib/client.js:1990-2001"]}
{"unit_id":"Summer-Perilla__dsh-ui-custom#card-en","repo":"Summer-Perilla/dsh-ui-custom","commit":"47c6b82123af062c200c697d394eb9dd343aa2f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ui-custom adds a visual editor to the DSH web UI. It lets users resize or move elements, change sidebar width, hide items, select multiple elements, snap changes to alignment guides, and undo or redo edits. Settings are saved in browser local storage; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:8-14","lib/client.js:977-1040","lib/client.js:1990-2001"]}
